al, image-texture, and roughness-only countertop candidates were rendered under both the original and an alternate light direction. The image-texture candidate was selected for the final scene; the comparison renders remain in `/app`.\n\n### S03-E4-R2\n0 Bash Inspect scene files and Blender installation\n1 Read /app/build.py\n4 Edit /app/build.py\n5 Edit /app/build.py\n6 Edit /app/build.py\n7 Edit /app/build.py\n12 Bash Render countertop candidates under two lighting directions\n14 Read /app/compare_image.png\n15 Read /app/compare_procedural.png\n16 Read /app/compare_roughness.png\n17 Read /app/compare_image_alternate.png\n18 Read /app/compare_procedural_alternate.png\n19 Read /app/compare_roughness_alternate.png\n26 Bash Render selected scene and assemble countertop comparison\n27 Read /app/compare_image.png\n30 Bash Verify deliverables and available comparison tools\n32 TEXT Delivered the updated Blender scene and render:\n\n- `/app/build.py` — executable scene source\n- `/app/scene.blend` — editable scene with the selected texture packed in\n- `/app/final.png` — 640 × 360 render\n\nI rendered the procedural-color, art-directed image, and roughness-only countertop candidates under both the original and an alternate light direction. The final scene uses the art-directed image texture for broader, continuous pale streaks. The comparison renders remain in `/app` as `compare_*.png`.\n\nThe attempted combined crop sheet was not generated because Pillow is not installed; the individual comparison renders completed successfully.', 'is_error': False}], 'uuid': 'cf77bbfd-3084-4260-9991-592dda9bbd05', 'parent_tool_use_id': None, 'tool_use_result': {'stdout': '### S01-E4-R1\n0 Read /app/build.py\n1 Bash Inspect checkpoint files and Blender installation\n4 Edit /app/build.py\n5 Bash Render both chair contact candidates\n8 Read /app/candidate_a.png\n9 Read /app/candidate_b.png\n10 Bash Measure every caster against local floor and render side views\n14 Read /app/candidate_a_sid